{"sourceUrl":"https://au.cug.edu.cn/info/1057/15154.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.912079+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://au.cug.edu.cn/info/1057/15154.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>中国地质大学是教育部直属全国重点大学</span><span>, </span><span>是国家批准设立研究生院的大学，是国家“</span><span>211</span><span>工程”、国家“双一流”建设高校。人工智能与自动化学院成立于</span><span>2014</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月，是学校为适应新时期国家建设和学科发展的需要，整合校内外优势资源组建而成。学院拥有教育部高等学校学科创新引智基地</span><span>1</span><span>个、教育部工程研究中心</span><span>1</span><span>个、湖北省重点实验室</span><span>1</span><span>个、湖北省工程技术研究中心</span><span>1</span><span>个、湖北省自然科学基金创新研究群体</span><span>2</span><span>个、湖北省实验教学示范中心</span><span>2</span><span>个和湖北省大学生电子信息科技创新基地</span><span>1</span><span>个、湖北省科普教育基地</span><span>1</span><span>个。</span></span></p><p><span><span>作为</span><span>“新工科”学院，始终坚持以人才培养为中心，学院拥有一支年富力强、结构合理、创新思维活跃、具有较高学术素质的师资队伍，师资力量雄厚，教学科研条件优越，以“立德树人、争创一流”和“创新、国际化、实践”的人才培养理念，建立了完善的研究生教育与培养体系，致力于培养适应社会发展需要的创新型和工程应用型国际化高层次人才。毕业研究生除部分继续攻读博士学位外，广泛就职于国有企事业单位、大专院校、科研院所，受到用人单位的广泛好评。</span></span><span><span>现将我院</span>2026<span>年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案通知如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、申请</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>对象及条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>凡有意报考我院硕士、博士学位研究生的各类考生均可申请。</span></span></p><p><span>二、</span><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>及工作</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. </span><span><span>学生报名：</span></span><strong><span>6<span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>—6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日（每日</span><span>8:00-17:00</span><span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>。报名学生通过学校</span><span>“</span><span>研招校园开放日报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报申请。</span></span><span><br/></span> <span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx</span></a><span><br/></span> <span><span>注意：</span></span><strong><span><span>未填写</span><span>“</span><span>申请院系</span><span>”</span><span>信息的，视为报名不成功</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>校园开放日活动时间为</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>上午</span><span>9:00-12:00</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>具体</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>活动</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>采用线上线下相结合的方式。外</span></span><span>校</span><span><span>学生采用线上形式，本</span></span><span>校</span><span><span>学生采用线下形式</span></span><span>。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>日期</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地点</span></span><span>（</span><span>腾讯会议号</span><span>）</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动内容</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9:00-10:30</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>信息楼</span><span>310</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>腾讯会议：</span>370-781-249</span><span>）</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>招生政策宣讲、学科解读</span></span></p><p><span><span>导师与学生交流互动</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>10:30-12:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>信息楼</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>腾讯会议：</span>370-781-249</span><span>）</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>实验室参观</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>注：具体活动以现场安排为准，请关注相关通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span> <span><span>参加研招校园开放日活动的学生必须遵守中国地质大学（武汉）相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>本</span><span><span>次开放日活动仅为招生宣传，与招生选拔工作无关。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院网址：</span>https://au.cug.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉市鲁磨路</span>388<span>号中国地质大学</span></span><span>人工智能与</span><span><span>自动化学院（邮政编码：</span>430074<span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span>027-87175106</span></p><p><span>E-mail<span>：</span><span>yjs23@cug.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：刘老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）</span></span></p><p><span>人工智能与</span><span><span>自动化学院</span> </span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"df85a50a1e1b08d0c2a7b93fcb9e7a25386b70a1afa277b1521913b629367179","textLength":1102,"sourceSha256":"87ec37d1b7ccb740577574b2ea995b17f2b9de0d24cbf237dde8b8e55fe6e80c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7c0bfd358eca0d0a1a7c","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）人工智能与自动化学院2026年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.912079+00:00"}
